      "content": "That's a really strong argument. I think I can use that. \n\nJust to be prepared for the meeting, can you quickly list out the most common criticisms or arguments from people who are totally against this kind of ESG focus? I want to make sure I'm not blindsided if someone brings up the downsides of prioritizing these issues.",
